  "job_B1.3.3_20251001_193212": {
    "text": "M\u00c6G GEHYRAN SE \u00d0E WYLE BE \u00deAM HALGAN m\u00e6dene Eugenian, Philyppus d\u00e6hter; hu heo\nSum \u00e6\u00feelboren \u00fe\u00e6gn w\u00e6s Philippus gehaten, \u00f0one asende se casere Commodus, \u00fee on \u00f0am dagum\nAnd he hine gesette to heahgerefan ofer Alexandrian and \u00e6gyfto lande, and het \u00fe\u00e6t he heolde \u00fea\n\u00d0\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6gn philippus n\u00e6s na gefullod on gode, for\u00fean \u00fee cristendom n\u00e6s \u00feagyt geond eall cu\u00f0, and seo\nHis wif w\u00e6s gecyged Claudia, be \u00fe\u00e6re he gestrynde tw\u00e6gen suna, Auitum and S\u00e6rgium, and ane\n\u00d0a bef\u00e6ste se f\u00e6der Philippus to lare \u00fe\u00e6t heo on woruldwysdome w\u00e6re getogen, \u00e6fter greciscre\nEugenia \u00fea, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6\u00f0ele m\u00e6den, wel \u00feeah on wisdome and on u\u00f0wytegunge.\n\u00dea becom hyre on hand \u00fe\u00e6s halgan apostoles lar Paules \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6ran ealles manncynnes lareowes.\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 hyre mod mycclum onbryrd \u00feuruh \u00fea halgen lare, \u00feeah \u00f0e heo \u00fea gyt h\u00e6\u00f0en w\u00e6re.\nHeo b\u00e6d \u00fea hyre f\u00e6der \u00fe\u00e6t heo f\u00e6ren moste geond his hames on Alexandiscre scyre.\nWolde swa cepan \u00fe\u00e6re cristenra lare, for\u00f0an \u00fee heo n\u00e6fde on \u00f0\u00e6re byrig n\u00e6nne geleaffulne mann \u00fee hi\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea EVGENIA ardlice f\u00e6rde o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t heo becom \u00fe\u00e6r \u00f0a cristenan sungen mid mycelre blisse \u00feus\nEugenia \u00fea mycclum wear\u00f0 onbryrd and mid wope gespr\u00e6c hire tw\u00e6gen cnihtas, \u00fe\u00e6re naman w\u00e6ron\n\u00dea w\u00e6ron gel\u00e6rede on leden and on grecisc, mid eugenian mid woruldlicra lare, and w\u00e6ron eunuchi,\n\u00d0a nam Eugenia hi on sundorspr\u00e6ce, het hi gebro\u00f0ra, and b\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t hi hyre f\u00e6x forcurfon on\nWolde \u00f0am cristenan genealecan on w\u00e6rlicum hiwe \u00fe\u00e6t heo ne wurde ameldod.\nHi f\u00e6rdon \u00f0a \u00fery and heora gef\u00e6ran forleton o\u00f0\u00fe\u00e6t hi becoman to \u00f0\u00e6re cristenra wununge, \u00fe\u00e6r hi\nOn \u00f0am ylcan d\u00e6ge com sum bisceop Helenus gehaten, haliges lifes, mid mycelre meniu anmodlice\n\u00dees bisceop worhta f\u00e6la wundra \u00feuruh god, and him wear\u00f0 geswutelod on sw\u00e6fne be \u00feysum, and eall\n\u00d0a gespr\u00e6c \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den sumne messepreost, Eutropius gehaten, \u00fe\u00e6t he hyre \u00e6rende abude \u00feam\n\u00dea \u00fe\u00e6s on mergen se m\u00e6ssepreost abead \u00fe\u00e6s m\u00e6denes word \u00feam m\u00e6ron bisceope.\n\u00dea het se bisceop hi gelangian, mycclum \u00feanciende \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan gode \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde him onwreon\nHe genam hi \u00fea onsundron and s\u00e6de hyre gewislice hw\u00e6t heo man ne w\u00e6s, and hwylcere m\u00e6g\u00fee, and\nTo hire twam cnihtum he cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hi heoldan \u00e6\u00feelborennyss on mode, \u00feeah \u00fee hi mannum \u00feeowdon,\n\u00dea bebead se biscop \u00feam gebogenan m\u00e6dene \u00fe\u00e6t heo swa \u00feurhwunade on \u00feam w\u00e6rlicum hiwe, o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t\nEugenia \u00fea wunode on \u00feam mynstre mid w\u00e6rlicum mode \u00feeah \u00fee heo m\u00e6den w\u00e6re, mid hyre twam\nHeo \u00feeah on lare \u00fe\u00e6s rihtan geleafan and on godcundlicum gewrytum mid godum wyllan, and wear\u00f0\nHyre geeuenl\u00e6hton eac hyre cnihtas, Protus et Iacinctus, on synderlicre drohtnunge, and hyre\nPhilippus \u00f0a se f\u00e6der forwear\u00f0 on mode, and seo modor Claudia mid murcnunge w\u00e6s fornumen, and\nHi axoden \u00e6t wyccum and \u00e6t wisum dryum, eac \u00e6t heora leasum godum be \u00fe\u00e6re godes \u00feinene.\nHim wear\u00f0 \u00fea ges\u00e6d to so\u00feum \u00feinge, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a godes hi gegripon for hyre godnysse.\n\u00dea gelyfde se f\u00e6der \u00fe\u00e6re leasunga and het asmi\u00f0igen of sm\u00e6tum golde hyre anlycnysse, and \u00fea\n\u00dea \u00e6fter \u00ferym gearum \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee heo gecyrred w\u00e6s gewat se abbod \u00fee hyre ealdor w\u00e6s.\nAnd \u00fea gebro\u00f0ra sona ceosan ongunnen Eugenian to abbude, for hyre arf\u00e6stan life, and nyston \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00d0a wear\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den mycclum hohful, hu heo \u00e6fre w\u00e6ras wissian sceolde.\nNe dorste swa \u00feeah hi ealle gedrefan and hyra ge\u00feeaht forseon, ac f\u00e6ng to \u00f0am hade.\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a Eugenia hym eallum gebysnode mid goddre gedrohtnunge to godes \u00feeowdome, and mid\nHyre geu\u00f0e \u00fea se \u00e6lmihtiga wealdend \u00fe\u00e6t heo untrume menn mihte geh\u00e6lan, swa hwylcne swa heo\nHeo aflygde eac swylce \u00fea fulan deofla fram ofs\u00e6ttum mannum \u00feurh so\u00f0ne geleafan.\n\u00dea w\u00e6s sum wif w\u00e6lig on \u00e6htum, Melantia gecyged, swi\u00f0e \u00feearle gedreht mid langsumum feofore,\nEugenia \u00fea hi gesmyrode mid gehalgodum ele and eac gemearcode mid rodetacne.\nAnd heo \u00fe\u00e6t re\u00f0e attor eall ut aspaw, \u00fee hyre d\u00e6rede, and wear\u00fe geh\u00e6led \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t halige m\u00e6den.\n\u00dea bead seo wydewe \u00feam m\u00e6dene sceattas for hyre h\u00e6le, ac heo hi forsoc, and tihte \u00f0a o\u00fere \u00fe\u00e6t heo\n\u00d0a gew\u00e6nde seo wydewe ham to hyre agenum and com si\u00f0\u00f0an gelome mid leasum mode to \u00feam\nAc \u00fea \u00fea heo geseah \u00fe\u00e6t seo so\u00f0f\u00e6ste f\u00e6mne hyre laca ne rohte, ne hyre rununga, \u00fea wear\u00f0 heo mid\nHeo b\u00e6d \u00fea Eugenian \u00fe\u00e6t heo hi geneosode, and ongan hyre s\u00e6cgan hyre sweartan ge\u00feohtas.\nCw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t heo w\u00e6re wydewe on \u00feam geare, and hyre wer l\u00e6fde unlytle \u00e6hta on lande and on feo and\nAnd unc n\u00e6s gem\u00e6ne man on \u00f0ysum lyfe.\nNu is min mod awend mycclum to \u00f0e, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu hlaford beo \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00e6hta and min.\nIc wene \u00fe\u00e6t hit ne sy unrihtwisnysse \u00e6tforan gode \u00feeah \u00f0e \u00feu wifes bruce and blysse on life.\n\u00d0a andwyrde Eugenia \u00feyssere olecunge, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00feam wife mid \u00feisum ingehyde, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman lustas gelome bep\u00e6ce\u00f0 and to sarnissum gel\u00e6da\u00f0 \u00fea \u00fee hi swi\u00f0ost lufia\u00f0.\n\u00c6fter \u00feissere tihtinge and on o\u00f0rum larum, beclypte seo myltestre \u00fe\u00e6t cl\u00e6ne m\u00e6den, and wolde hi\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a Eugenia hi gebletsode, and cw\u00e6\u00f0 to \u00f0\u00e6re sceande \u00fe\u00e6t heo so\u00f0lice w\u00e6re galnysse ontendnyss\nHabban \u00feine \u00e6hta \u00feine gelican.\nWe habba\u00f0 ealle \u00f0ing mid \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan drihtne.\n\u00d0a wear\u00f0 Melantia micclum ofsceamod, wende \u00fe\u00e6t heo wolde hyre word ameldian buton heo sylf on\nF\u00e6rde \u00fea ardlice to Alexandrian byrig, to \u00feam heahger\u00e6fan, \u00fee w\u00e6s gehaten Philippus, Eugenian\nCw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t heo eode to hyre licgendre, on l\u00e6ces hiwe, and hi wolde forlycgan, gif heo \u00fe\u00e6t bysmor\nAc ic hrymde sona mid sarlicre st\u00e6mne o\u00fe\u00fe\u00e6t an minra wimmanna me wi\u00f0 hine ahredde.\n\u00d0a gelyfde Philippus \u00fe\u00e6re facenfyllan segene, and swi\u00f0e gehatheort het hi gef\u00e6ccan, and eac \u00f0a\n\u00dea com se d\u00e6g \u00fee se dema ges\u00e6tte.\nAnd w\u00e6ron gegeorcode \u00fea re\u00f0an wyta.\nAnd wurdon gef\u00e6tte \u00e6tforan \u00feam deman \u00fea unscildigan cristenan on sw\u00e6rtum racent\u00e6gum.\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Philippus mid fullum graman to Eugenian his agenre dehter, Sege \u00feu forscyldeguda hwi\n\u00d0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Eugenia \u00fe\u00e6t heo ea\u00fee mihte \u00fe\u00e6s forlyres unhlisan hi beladian, and Melantian onsage mid\n\u00d0a swor Philippus \u00fe\u00e6t he fri\u00f0ian wolde \u00fea leasan wudewan, \u00f0eah \u00fee heo gelignod wur\u00f0e.\n\u00dea b\u00e6d Eugenia \u00fe\u00e6t seo wyln sceolde s\u00e6cgan \u00feam deman hu hit gedon w\u00e6re, and hu heo hyre\nAnd se gerefa het eac \u00fea cnihtas Melantian hyredes cy\u00f0an be \u00f0ison gif hi \u00feis gehyrdon.\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 seo wyln \u00fe\u00e6t heo wyste gefyrn hu Eugenia ferde fracodlice on forlygre, and wolde \u00fea \u00e6t\n\u00d0a s\u00e6don \u00fea hyredmenn \u00fe\u00e6t hit so\u00f0 w\u00e6re, and ealle mid a\u00f0e Eugenian forlugan.\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 se ger\u00e6fa \u00feearle gebolgen, and axude Eugenian hu heo ana mihte ealle \u00fea gewytan aw\u00e6gan\nHw\u00e6t \u00f0a Eugenia seo \u00e6\u00feele f\u00e6mne cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t heo wolde hi sylfe bediglian, and criste anum hyre\n\u00c6fter \u00feysum wordum heo tot\u00e6r hyre gew\u00e6du and \u00e6t\u00e6wde hyre breost \u00feam breman Philippe, and\nAnd ic for cristes lufe forl\u00e6t eow ealle, and middaneardlice lustas swa swa meox forseah.\nHer synd eac \u00fea cnihtas \u00fee ic cydde mine digolnysse, Protus et Iacinctus, \u00feine fostercyld, mid \u00f0am ic\n\u00d0a oncneow Philippus swa swa f\u00e6der Eugenian, and Auitus and S\u00e6rgius hyra agene swyster, and hyra\n\u00deis wear\u00f0 sona gecyd Claudian \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6der, and heo mid wundrunge wear\u00f0 befangen, and to\nHi \u00fea gefretewodon \u00fea f\u00e6mnan mid golde hyre un\u00feances, and up ges\u00e6tton to him.\n\u00dea clypode \u00fe\u00e6t folc \u00fe\u00e6t Crist w\u00e6re so\u00f0 god, and hi ealle herodon \u00feonne h\u00e6lend mid wuldre.\nEugenia h\u00e6fde \u00e6r ge\u00feingod \u00fe\u00e6re leasan Melantian to hyre leofan f\u00e6der, \u00fe\u00e6t heo mid wytum ne\nAc Crist sylf asende sw\u00e6gende fyr ufan of heofonum, \u00fe\u00e6t menn onhawoden, to Melantian botle and\n\u00dea wurdon gefullode Philippus and Claudia and heora tw\u00e6gen suna mid so\u00f0um geleafan, and seo\n\u00d0a wurdon ge\u00e6dniwode on \u00f0am eahteo\u00f0an geare \u00fea forl\u00e6tenan cyrcan, and seo geleaffulnyss weox.\nPhilippus \u00fea asende to Seuero \u00feam casere, and s\u00e6de \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea Cristenan swi\u00f0e fremoden his cynerice\n\u00dea ge\u00feafode se casere \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0am ger\u00e6fan, and Alexandria seo burh sona wear\u00f0 afylled mid mycclum\nAnd on gehwylcum burgum blissoden \u00fea cristenan and mid wur\u00f0fulnysse God wur\u00f0odon, eac for\nAnd Philippus forgeaf f\u00e6la eahta \u00feam cristenum him to gem\u00e6nan brice, and hi gemundode.\n\u00c6fter \u00feisum gelamp \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a leasan h\u00e6\u00f0enan wr\u00e6gdon Philippum to \u00f0am fores\u00e6den casere, s\u00e6don \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00dea wear\u00f0 se casere sona geyrsod, and bebead Philippe \u00fe\u00e6t he buge to his godum, o\u00f0\u00f0e w\u00e6re ben\u00e6med\n\u00dea d\u00e6lde Philippus digollice his \u00e6hta geond ealle \u00fea scyre cyrcum and \u00feearfum, and \u00feurh mycelne\n\u00d0a \u00e6fter tw\u00e6lf mon\u00f0um gemunde se casere hw\u00e6t him ges\u00e6d w\u00e6s and s\u00e6nde fram rome o\u00f0erne\n\u00d0a com se gerefa and hine acw\u00e6llan ne dorste on \u00fe\u00e6s folces gewytnysse for heora freondr\u00e6dene, ac\n\u00d0a eoden to cyrcean mid swi\u00f0licum facne, and \u00f0one m\u00e6ran biscop on his geb\u00e6dum ofslogan.\nAc he wunade swa \u00f0eah on \u00feam wundum cucu geond \u00fereora daga f\u00e6c and gefrefrode \u00fea cristenan,\nEugenia h\u00e6fde \u00e6r \u00fean asteald mynecena mynster mid mycelre gehealdsumnysse, and seo modor\nAnd hi si\u00fe\u00fean ealle endemes f\u00e6rdon, seo modor and seo dohtor, to \u00f0\u00e6re m\u00e6ran Rome byrig, and \u00f0a\nAnd \u00fea romaniscan wytan hi wel underf\u00e6ngon, and for \u00fe\u00e6re ealdan cy\u00f0\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6\u00f0elan Philippes.\n\u00dea ges\u00e6tton \u00fea wytan sona \u00fea cnihtas on twam heafodburgum on healicum wur\u00f0mynte, \u00e6nne on\nEugenia \u00fea wunode on Rome, and hire coman to gehwylce m\u00e6denu, and heo hi gebegde mid hyre\n\u00dea w\u00e6s on Rome byrig sum cyneboren m\u00e6den, Basilla gehaten, on h\u00e6\u00f0enscype wunigende, seo\n\u00d0a sende Eugenia \u00fea tw\u00e6gen halgan, Protum and Iacinctum, to \u00f0am h\u00e6\u00f0enen m\u00e6dene.\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea Basilla mid blysse hi underf\u00e6ng, and deges and nihtes mid \u00feam deorwur\u00f0um halgum godes\n\u00dea wurdon gelome \u00fea leofan m\u00e6denu Eugenia and Basilla, and eac se biscop, on sunderspr\u00e6ce swi\u00f0e\n\u00deurh \u00f0as twa m\u00e6dena manega o\u00f0re becoman to Cristes geleafan, and to cl\u00e6nre drohtnunge.\n\u00d0urh Claudian becoman eac cl\u00e6ne wudewan mid godum wyllan to godes geleafan.\nAnd f\u00e6la cnihta on Crist gelyfden \u00feurh \u00f0a tw\u00e6gen halgan Protum et Iacinctum.\nBasilla h\u00e6fde enne h\u00e6\u00f0ene wogere, Pompeius gecyged, swi\u00f0e \u00e6\u00f0elboren, \u00feam geu\u00f0e se casere \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00dea gesohte se cniht \u00fe\u00e6s kaseres fett, and \u00fea Romaniscan wytan mid woplicre ceorunge him mid\nHw\u00e6t \u00fea se casere cw\u00e6\u00f0 him to andsware \u00fe\u00e6t Basilla sceolde gebugan to \u00f0am cnihte, o\u00fe\u00fee hi man\nAnd Eugenian he het his godum geoffrian, o\u00f0\u00f0e hi man mid wytum welreowlice acwealde.\nHe het eac acw\u00e6llan ealle \u00fea cristenan, gif hi noldon bugan to \u00f0am bysmorfullum h\u00e6\u00f0enscype.\n\u00dea nolde Basilla brydguman geceosan n\u00e6nne butan Crist \u00fee heo gecoren h\u00e6fde, and wear\u00f0 \u00fea\n\u00c6fter \u00feysum wordum \u00fea tw\u00e6gen godes halgan, Protus and Iacinctus, wurdon sona gel\u00e6hte, and hi\nHi wurdon \u00fea gel\u00e6dde to \u00fe\u00e6re la\u00f0an anlicnysse, ac heo tofeol sona to heora fotum formolsnod, swa\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00fe se dema \u00fe\u00e6t hi mid drycr\u00e6fte \u00fea anlicnyssa towurpon, and wear\u00f0 gebolgen.\nHet \u00fea beh\u00e6fdian \u00f0a halgan cy\u00f0eras, and hi swa ferdon mid sige to Criste.\n\u00d0as martyras n\u00e6ron n\u00e6fre on life \u00feurh wif besmytene, ac hi wunedon on cl\u00e6nnysse o\u00f0 heora lifes\n\u00c6fter \u00feysum wear\u00f0 geleaht seo geleaffulla Eugenia, and to \u00feam h\u00e6\u00f0enan temple getogen mid\n\u00d0a geb\u00e6d Eugenia hi to \u00f0am \u00e6lmihtigan Gode, and \u00fe\u00e6t deofles tempel grundlunga tofeoll, and on\n\u00dea het se casere ahon anne weorcstan on hyre halgan swuran, and hi bescufan on \u00f0a ea.\nEac se stan tob\u00e6rst and heo s\u00e6t up on \u00feam w\u00e6tere, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0a cristenan tocneowan \u00fe\u00e6t Crist w\u00e6s mid\n\u00d0a het se casere hi si\u00f0\u00f0an bescufan on byrnende ofen, \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6r hate ba\u00f0u w\u00e6ron, ac \u00fe\u00e6t fyr wear\u00f0\nHeo wear\u00f0 \u00fea gebroht into blindum cwearterne, and geond tw\u00e6ntig daga hyre n\u00e6s gety\u00f0od \u00e6niges\nAc se H\u00e6lend com mid heofonlicum leohte, and brohte \u00f0am m\u00e6dene m\u00e6rne bigleofon, snawhwitne\n\u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 se H\u00e6lend to \u00f0am halgan m\u00e6dene, Eala \u00f0u Eugenia, ne beo \u00feu afyrht.\nIc eom \u00fein h\u00e6lend, \u00fee \u00feu healice wur\u00f0ost, and mid eallum mode and m\u00e6gne lufast.\nOn \u00feam d\u00e6ge \u00fea scealt cuman to me \u00fee ic com to mannum, and on minre gebyrdtide \u00f0u bist on\n\u00dea com se cw\u00e6llere on cristes akennednysse d\u00e6ge, asend fram \u00feam casere, and he \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6den\nHeo wear\u00f0 \u00fea gemartyrod and cristene menn hi bebyrgdon.\n\u00d0a weop seo modor mid mycelre sarnysse \u00e6t hyre byrgene, o\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6t heo hi geseah on gastlicre gesih\u00f0e\nSeo modor gewat \u00f0a of worulde to heofonum on \u00f0am sunnand\u00e6ge, and \u00fea suna hi bestodon, Sergius\nSy wuldor and lof \u00feam welwyllendan drihtne, on ealra worulda woruld, ealra his weld\u00e6da; AMEN.",
